{"id": "24692edd35a2914d", "field": "text", "it": "L'anziano Dawnstrider si trova a ⟦Flame Crest=Cimiero Ardente⟧, nelle ⟦Burning Steppes=Steppe Ardenti⟧.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g16-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "24692edd35a2914d", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "246db1f2d7aa84a4", "field": "text", "it": "Ho vestito dei re. Con l'addestramento giusto, potrai farlo anche tu.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g08-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "246db1f2d7aa84a4", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "2473a26572c07e7d", "field": "text", "it": "Che meraviglia vedere i fiorellini resistere al freddo di Dun Morogh... ma qui fuori non troverai erboristi. Dovrai andare a ⟦Ironforge=Forgiardente⟧ per addestrarti in quella professione.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g16-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "2473a26572c07e7d", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "2476c862082c2c36", "field": "text", "it": "Quei goblin dovrebbero vergognarsi. Bah!", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g16-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "2476c862082c2c36", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
